# Build output must never enter the image. Beyond bloating the context, a copied
# obj/ carries a project.assets.json full of host paths, which overwrites the
# restore done inside the container and fails the build with NETSDK1064.
**/bin/
**/obj/

.git/
.github/
.vs/
.idea/
.claude/

.env
docker-compose*.yml
**/Dockerfile
*.md
